OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart to Monday but wet and windy
OL,7,Fconditions to follow in the coming
OL,8,Fdays, any dry interludes will be short-
OL,9,Flived. Temperatures remain above
OL,10,Faverage for the time of year.
